    "notes": "The existing issuerEntity TRON DAO Reserve is preserved as the protocol reserve/issuer identity; no separate incorporated legal issuer or GENIUS route is inferred. The official data page and API disclose crypto and stablecoin collateral, not proof of permitted GENIUS reserve compliance. Public PSM swap procedures support redemptionPolicyPresent, but they do not establish unconditional cash redemption. No monthly independent CPA reserve examination was located; live issuer reserve data is not such an attestation. Issuer terms restrict U.S. access, but this is not a GENIUS authorization or foreign exception. No GENIUS-specific public action was found in the bounded search; actions against related persons or different tokens are not attributed to USDD. Opened primary sources still support pre-effective treatment and not-yet-restricted DASP status, not a conclusion that every U.S. activity is otherwise lawful.",
